# A scripted ride for the goldens: wait two seconds on the pad (riding starts
# once the dunes' collider is in, normally within a few frames), then full
# throttle north up the lane. The chase camera climbs toward the crest near
# frame 530; the rider camera then sees the block ahead.
#   functor -d examples/hoverbike run native -- --input-script ride.script \
#     --capture-frame /tmp/f.png --capture-at-frame 530 --capture-size 1600x1200
120 W down
760 C down
761 C up
